tabs: File Write Edit Collaboration [View]
## Panes
  L Outline icon=foreground_list.svg name=Outline (Ctrl+Shift+O)
  L Notes icon=foreground_file-text.svg (checked) name=Notes (Ctrl+Shift+K)
  S Cards icon=foreground_grid.svg name=Cards (Ctrl+Shift+D)
  S Source icon=foreground_source.svg name=Source
  S Help icon=foreground_help.svg name=Help
  S Changes icon=foreground_changes.svg name=Changes (Ctrl+Shift+H)
  S Side Panes icon=foreground_dock.svg (checked) name=Side Panes
## Show
  L Preview icon=foreground_visibility.svg name=Preview PDF (Ctrl+Shift+P)
  S Statistics icon=foreground_statistics.svg name=Statistics…
  S Line Numbers icon=foreground_line-numbers.svg name=Line Numbers
  S Status Bar icon=foreground_status-bar.svg (checked) name=Status Bar
## Folding
  S Fold Here icon=foreground_fold.svg name=Fold or Unfold Here (Ctrl+Shift+.)
  S Fold Sections icon=foreground_fold-sections.svg name=Fold All (Sections Only)
  S Headings Only icon=foreground_heading.svg name=Headings Only
  S Unfold All icon=foreground_unfold.svg name=Unfold All
## Window
  S Fullscreen icon=foreground_view-fullscreen.svg name=Fullscreen (Ctrl+Shift+F)
  S Document Type icon=foreground_file.svg name=Document Type
  S Working As icon=foreground_account.svg name=Working As
  S Ribbon icon=foreground_ribbon.svg (checked) name=Ribbon
  S Theme icon=foreground_theme.svg name=Theme
  T Smaller Text icon=foreground_text-smaller.svg name=Smaller Text
  T Larger Text icon=foreground_text-larger.svg name=Larger Text
